# Local-development artifacts produced by `go build` / `airdefenders.exe`.
# CI builds via the Dockerfile in this directory, so the binary + the SQLite
# DB files are never produced under version control on any reproducible
# build path.
airdefenders
airdefenders.exe
local-scores.db
local-scores.db-shm
local-scores.db-wal
airdefenders.stdout.log
airdefenders.stderr.log
